{"seq":1,"slug":"graphql-fundamentals","title":"GraphQL 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/graphql/graphql-fundamentals","wordCount":641,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"graphql-基础\">GraphQL 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GraphQL 是 Facebook 于 2015 年开源的 API 查询语言和运行时。与 REST 的&quot;服务端定义响应结构&quot;不同，GraphQL 让<strong>客户端精确声明需要的数据</strong>，服务端只返回请求的字段。这从根本上解决了 REST 的两大痛点：过度获取（over-fetching）和不足获取（under-fetching）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt;|Query/Mutation| B[GraphQL 服务器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Resolver 1]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Resolver 2]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Resolver 3]&#10;    C --&gt; F[数据库]&#10;    D --&gt; G[微服务 API]&#10;    E --&gt; H[缓存]&#10;    subgraph 数据源&#10;        F&#10;        G&#10;        H&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[客户端] --&gt;|Query/Mutation| B[GraphQL 服务器]\n    B --&gt; C[Resolver 1]\n    B --&gt; D[Resolver 2]\n    B --&gt; E[Resolver 3]\n    C --&gt; F[数据库]\n    D --&gt; G[微服务 API]\n    E --&gt; H[缓存]\n    subgraph 数据源\n        F\n        G\n        H\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>REST</th>\n<th>GraphQL</th>\n<th>gRPC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>HTTP（通常 POST）</td>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据获取</td>\n<td>服务端定义</td>\n<td>客户端定义</td>\n<td>服务端定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端点数量</td>\n<td>多个 URL</td>\n<td>单一端点</td>\n<td>多个方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型系统</td>\n<td>无（依赖文档）</td>\n<td>强类型 Schema</td>\n<td>Protobuf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时数据</td>\n<td>WebSocket/SSE</td>\n<td>Subscription</td>\n<td>双向流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>HTTP 缓存友好</td>\n<td>需要客户端缓存</td>\n<td>无标准缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"类型系统与-schema\">类型系统与 Schema</h2><p>GraphQL 的核心是<strong>Schema</strong>——它定义了 API 的完整类型图。Schema 既是文档又是契约，客户端和服务端都围绕它工作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type Query {&#10;  user(id: ID!): User&#10;  users(filter: UserFilter, pagination: PaginationInput): UserConnection!&#10;  me: User!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Mutation {&#10;  createUser(input: CreateUserInput!): User!&#10;  updateUser(id: ID!, input: UpdateUserInput!): User!&#10;  deleteUser(id: ID!): Boolean!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type User {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  name: String!&#10;  email: String!&#10;  avatar: String&#10;  posts(first: Int, after: String): PostConnection!&#10;  createdAt: DateTime!&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Post {&#10;  id: ID!&#10;  title: String!&#10;  content: String!&#10;  author: User!&#10;  tags: [Tag!]!&#10;}&#10;&#10;input CreateUserInput {&#10;  name: String!&#10;  email: String!&#10;}&#10;&#10;input UserFilter {&#10;  role: Role&#10;  createdAfter: DateTime&#10;  search: String&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Query {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user(id: ID!): User</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  users(filter: UserFilter, pagination: PaginationInput): UserConnection!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  me: User!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Mutation {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createUser(input: CreateUserInput!): User!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  updateUser(id: ID!, input: UpdateUserInput!): User!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deleteUser(id: ID!): Boolean!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  email: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  avatar: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  posts(first: Int, after: String): PostConnection!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createdAt: DateTime!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Post {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  content: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  author: User!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tags: [Tag!]!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>input CreateUserInput {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  email: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>input UserFilter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  role: Role</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createdAfter: DateTime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  search: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>GraphQL 的类型系统包括五种基础标量（<code>String</code>、<code>Int</code>、<code>Float</code>、<code>Boolean</code>、<code>ID</code>）和四种复合类型（<code>Object</code>、<code>Input</code>、<code>Enum</code>、<code>Interface/Union</code>）。<code>!</code> 表示非空。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;&#10;const createUserInput = z.object({&#10;  name: z.string().min(2).max(50),&#10;  email: z.string().email(),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const userFilter = z.object({&#10;  role: z.enum([&#39;USER&#39;, &#39;ADMIN&#39;, &#39;MODERATOR&#39;]).optional(),&#10;  createdAfter: z.coerce.date().optional(),&#10;  search: z.string().optional(),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> createUserInput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  email: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userFilter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  role: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ADMIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MODERATOR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">optional</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  createdAfter: z.coerce.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">optional</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  search: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">optional</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"查询与变更\">查询与变更</h2><p><strong>Query</strong> 是只读操作，<strong>Mutation</strong> 是写操作。客户端通过声明式语法精确指定需要的字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"query GetUserWithPosts($userId: ID!) {&#10;  user(id: $userId) {&#10;    id&#10;    name&#10;    email&#10;    posts(first: 5) {&#10;      edges {&#10;        node {&#10;          id&#10;          title&#10;          createdAt&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;      pageInfo {&#10;        hasNextPage&#10;        endCursor&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;mutation CreateUser($input: CreateUserInput!) {&#10;  createUser(input: $input) {&#10;    id&#10;    name&#10;    email&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>query GetUserWithPosts($userId: ID!) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user(id: $userId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    posts(first: 5) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      edges {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          createdAt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      pageInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        hasNextPage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        endCursor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mutation CreateUser($input: CreateUserInput!) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createUser(input: $input) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个查询可以在<strong>单次请求中获取多个关联资源</strong>——这正是 GraphQL 解决 under-fetching 的方式。REST 需要 3 次请求（用户 → 文章列表 → 每篇文章的标签），GraphQL 一次搞定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"resolver-架构\">Resolver 架构</h2><p>Resolver 是 GraphQL 的执行引擎——每个字段对应一个 Resolver 函数，负责获取该字段的数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ResolverContext {&#10;  currentUser: User | null;&#10;  dataSources: DataSources;&#10;  loaders: DataLoaders;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const resolvers = {&#10;  Query: {&#10;    user: async (_: unknown, args: { id: string }, ctx: ResolverContext) =&gt; {&#10;      return ctx.dataSources.userService.getById(args.id);&#10;    },&#10;    users: async (_: unknown, args: { filter: UserFilter; pagination: PaginationInput }, ctx: ResolverContext) =&gt; {&#10;      return ctx.dataSources.userService.list(args.filter, args.pagination);&#10;    },&#10;    me: async (_: unknown, __: unknown, ctx: ResolverContext) =&gt; {&#10;      if (!ctx.currentUser) throw new AuthenticationError(&#39;Not authenticated&#39;);&#10;      return ctx.currentUser;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  User: {&#10;    posts: async (parent: User, args: { first: number; after?: string }, ctx: ResolverContext) =&gt; {&#10;      return ctx.dataSources.postService.getByAuthor(parent.id, args);&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  Post: {&#10;    author: async (parent: Post, _: unknown, ctx: ResolverContext) =&gt; {&#10;      return ctx.loaders.userLoader.load(parent.authorId);&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"ba