">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">after</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResolverContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.dataSources.postService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getByAuthor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parent.id, args);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  Post: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    author</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResolverContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.loaders.userLoader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parent.authorId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Resolver 的执行是自顶向下的：先解析 Query 根字段，再递归解析返回类型中的每个字段。<strong>DataLoader</strong> 是避免 N+1 查询的关键——它将同一事件循环中的多个 <code>.load(id)</code> 调用批量合并为一次数据库查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订阅与实时数据\">订阅与实时数据</h2><p><strong>Subscription</strong> 是 GraphQL 的实时数据机制，基于 WebSocket 或 SSE 实现服务端推送。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"graphql\" data-code=\"type Subscription {&#10;  messageAdded(channelId: ID!): Message!&#10;  userStatusChanged(userId: ID!): UserStatus!&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type Subscription {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  messageAdded(channelId: ID!): Message!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  userStatusChanged(userId: ID!): UserStatus!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const subscriptionResolvers = {&#10;  Subscription: {&#10;    messageAdded: {&#10;      subscribe: (_: unknown, args: { channelId: string }, ctx: ResolverContext) =&gt; {&#10;        return ctx.pubsub.asyncIterator(`CHANNEL_${args.channelId}`);&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> subscriptionResolvers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  Subscription: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messageAdded: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">channelId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResolverContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.pubsub.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">asyncIterator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`CHANNEL_${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channelId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Subscription 适合聊天消息、通知推送、实时协作等场景。但它增加了基础设施复杂度——需要持久连接管理、重连策略和水平扩展支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GraphQL 让客户端精确声明数据需求，解决 REST 的 over-fetching 和 under-fetching</li>\n<li>Schema 是强类型契约，既是文档又是验证层，客户端和服务端围绕它协作</li>\n<li>Resolver 自顶向下递归解析，DataLoader 通过批量加载避免 N+1 问题</li>\n<li>Subscription 基于 WebSocket 实现实时推送，适合聊天、通知等场景</li>\n<li>GraphQL 适合多客户端（Web/Mobile/IoT）场景，单一端点满足不同数据需求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GraphQL 基础","id":"graphql-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类型系统与 Schema","id":"类型系统与-schema"},{"level":2,"text":"查询与变更","id":"查询与变更"},{"level":2,"text":"Resolver 架构","id":"resolver-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅与实时数据","id":"订阅与实时数据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/rest-api-design/error-handling"},"next":{"title":"Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/api-design/graphql/schema-design"}}